Added Cisco ACI (`cisco_aci`, aliases `aci`, `aci-nxos` and `aci_nxos`) as its own OS for ACI leaf and spine switches. A parser can now register for several OSes by stacking `@register`; `cls.os` and `cls.command` keep the primary registration (the decorator closest to the class). The NX-OS parsers for `show version`, `show vlan`, `show vpc`, `show environment`, `show interface brief`, `show interface status`, `show ip interface brief`, `show ip route`, `show lldp neighbors`, `show lldp neighbors detail`, `show module` and `show vrf detail` are registered for ACI too. Other NX-OS parsers do not resolve for ACI.
